### **Technical Details:**

_**store/dialogStore**_ 

```typescript
export interface DialogOptions {
  id: symbol;
  title:string;
  variant:'neutral' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'danger'
  titleicon?:string;
  iconPosition? : 'left' | 'right';
  description? : string; 
  component: Component;
  props?: Record<string, any>;
  buttons?: ButtonProps[] ;
  cancelButton?: buttonprops;
  closeOnEsc?: boolean;
  closeOnOverlayClick?: boolean;
  zIndex?: number;
}
```

* create this store to handle the **stack** of this dialogs using vueuse `createGlobalState` (see useLightboxStore)
* actions will be 

    * `openDialog`
    * `closeDialog`
    * `closeAllDialogs`

* multiple alerts can be opened above each other 

_**create organism/AlertDialog**_

* use Reka Ui dialog <custom data-type="smartlink" data-id="id-2">https://reka-ui.com/docs/components/dialog#dialog</custom> 
* use `<component :is>` to render the content component 
* use `LuiText` , `LuiIcon` , `LuiButton`
